      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's understandable that you might be looking for a natural treatment and considering your friend's experience, but even though many herbs are natural, they're not always safe to take with medications. St. John's Wort can increase the enzyme that breaks down hormones in your body, which may reduce the effectiveness of your birth control pill. This is particularly important to discuss with your doctor, as they can help you navigate your options intelligently and safely, without necessarily needing to see them in person if you are comfortable doing so through a telehealth appointment.",
